  "name": "Italian Chicken Sausage and Peppers",
  "subtitle": "Roasted peppers, tomatoes, onion, and sausage",
  "description": "A colorful sheet-pan main with sweet peppers, tomatoes, onion, balsamic seasoning, and sliced chicken sausage, finished with fresh oregano.",
